From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:12:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/13] mmc: rtd129x: add eMMC host for RTD1295/RTD1296

Read the eMMC on the Banana Pi BPI-W2 at 52 MHz, 8 bits.

The DesignWare IDMAC on this SoC needs a bus-bridge sync, a DMAC reset
per transfer, and a wait for the last read data. Add optional dw_mmc
hooks for this. End each descriptor chain on a descriptor the IDMAC
does not own.

Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
---
